    ch_intro: "{n} chest(s), €{e} in all, {r}; first riddles on {d}. Its announcement is engraved on chain and signed by the author: GodGift Core checked the signature, the engraving and the manifest by itself. Its keys carry its number: no other hunt can open them. Everything opens by itself, right here, on time.",
